  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">World Border 是一個極簡且可配置的模組，允許創建自定義的世界邊界，限制世界的大小。這可以防止檔案無限增大，或讓玩家群體保持更緊密的聯繫。您也可以在配置中設置當觸碰世界邊界時繞回世界另一側。這將把您傳送到負坐標（如果您觸碰的是正邊界），反之亦然。這樣可以在限制世界大小的同時實現無限循環的世界。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置選項：</span></p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableCustomOverworldBorder</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，使用 overworldBorderCoords 來設定邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableCustomNetherBorder</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，使用 netherBorderCoords 來設定邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableCustomEndBorder</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，使用 endBorderCoords 來設定邊界。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldLoopToOppositeBorder</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，不會將玩家傳送到靠近原位置的內部，而是從正 x/z 坐標傳送到負坐標，反之亦然。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>distanceTeleportedBack</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10，最小 0，最大 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">觸碰邊界後，玩家被傳送到邊界內的方塊數量。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nearBorderMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"You're getting close to the world border!\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當玩家距離世界邊界在 'distanceTeleportedBack' 範圍內時發送的訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hitBorderMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"You've hit the world border, and were teleported inside!\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當玩家觸碰世界邊界時發送的訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loopBorderMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"You've hit the world border, and have looped around the world!\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當玩家觸碰邊界且 'shouldLoopToOppositeBorder' 啟用時發送的訊息。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>overworldBorderPositiveX</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5000，最小 0，最大 100000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於正 X 坐標的主世界邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>overworldBorderNegativeX</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -5000，最小 -100000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於負 X 坐標的主世界邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>overworldBorderPositiveZ</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5000，最小 0，最大 100000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於正 Z 坐標的主世界邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>overworldBorderNegativeZ</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -5000，最小 -100000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於負 Z 坐標的主世界邊界。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>netherBorderPositiveX</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 625，最小 0，最大 100000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於正 X 坐標的地獄邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>netherBorderNegativeX</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -625，最小 -100000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於負 X 坐標的地獄邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>netherBorderPositiveZ</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 625，最小 0，最大 100000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於正 Z 坐標的地獄邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>netherBorderNegativeZ</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -625，最小 -100000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於負 Z 坐標的地獄邊界。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>endBorderPositiveX</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5000，最小 0，最大 100000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於正 X 坐標的終界邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>endBorderNegativeX</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -5000，最小 -100000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於負 X 坐標的終界邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>endBorderPositiveZ</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5000，最小 0，最大 100000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於正 Z 坐標的終界邊界。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>endBorderNegativeZ</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -5000，最小 -100000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">位於負 Z 坐標的終界邊界。</span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Description\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>當接近邊界時，玩家將收到以下訊息：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/world-border/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"653\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>觸碰世界邊界且 enableLoop 啟用時的訊息。</strong></strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/world-border/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"892\" height=\"69\"><br><br><strong>當 disableLoop 時觸碰邊界，玩家將收到訊息並被傳送到邊界內 10 格。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/world-border/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"871\" height=\"39\"></strong><br><br><strong>循環運作方式如下：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/world-border/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"395\" height=\"248\"><br><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在地獄中使用巧妙的代碼以避免掉入熔岩或到達地獄頂部。</span></em></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
